{"title":"P12209 - P12209 [蓝桥杯 2023 国 Python B] 交易账本 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-13-P12209-P12209-蓝桥杯-2023-国-Python-B-交易账本-洛谷","date":"2026-05-12T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:50:12.281Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-13-P12209-P12209-蓝桥杯-2023-国-Python-B-交易账本-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"洛谷-P12209-交易账本-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P12209-交易账本-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P12209] 交易账本 - 洛谷\"></a>[洛谷 P12209] 交易账本 - 洛谷</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷</li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★★☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法, 数据结构</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 交易账本的合法性检查</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><p>在本题中，我们需要模拟一个交易账本，该账本记录了一系列的交易。每个交易包括多个输出项，每个输出项都有一个账户ID和一个金额。我们需要判断这些交易是否合法，即每个交易的输出金额是否等于其输入金额的总和，并且每个输出项是否已经被使用过。</p>\n<p><strong>输入格式</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一行是一个整数 ( t )，表示交易的数量。</li>\n<li>每个交易由两部分组成：<ul>\n<li>第一部分是一个整数 ( n )，表示该交易的输出项数量。</li>\n<li>第二部分是两个整数 ( m ) 和 ( m+1 )，分别表示输出项的数量和下一个交易的索引。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>接下来的 ( 2n ) 行每行包含两个整数 ( s ) 和 ( e )，表示第 ( i ) 个交易的起始和结束索引。</li>\n<li>最后一行包含一个整数 ( k )，表示需要检查的账户ID的数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>输出格式</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果所有交易都合法，输出 “YES”。</li>\n<li>如果存在不合法的交易，输出 “NO”。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路\"><a href=\"#算法思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路\"></a>算法思路</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>问题本质</strong>: 这是一个典型的合法性检查问题，涉及到对交易数据的遍历和验证。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>每个交易的输出项数量和起始索引。</li>\n<li>每个输出项的账户ID和金额。</li>\n<li>需要确保每个输出项的金额等于其输入金额的总和，并且每个输出项未被使用过。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>:<ul>\n<li>遍历每个交易，检查其合法性。</li>\n<li>对于每个交易，遍历其输出项，检查金额是否匹配。</li>\n<li>使用一个二维数组来记录每个输出项的使用情况。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用滚动数组来减少空间复杂度。</li>\n<li>预处理输入数据，提前计算一些中间结果以减少重复计算。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>:<ul>\n<li>选择这种基于遍历和验证的方法，因为它能够有效地解决这个问题。</li>\n<li>对比其他算法，如动态规划或图论方法，它们在这个问题中不太适用，因为问题的本质不是最优化或寻找最大值/最小值。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导\"></a>4.3 数学推导</h4><ul>\n<li>在这个问题中，数学推导不是必需的，因为主要问题是逻辑验证，而不是需要通过数学公式来解决的问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> input_data:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    ptr = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    t_str = input_data[ptr]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    t = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(t_str)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(t):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">        m = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        a = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            icnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">            ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            is_special = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            current_input_ok = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            total_input_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(icnt):</span><br><span class=\"line\">                source_id = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                output_idx = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                </span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> source_id == -<span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> output_idx == -<span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    is_special = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> source_id &lt; i <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> f[source_id][output_idx]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    total_input_val += a[source_id][output_idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    f[source_id][output_idx] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    current_input_ok = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> current_input_ok:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            ocnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">            ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            total_output_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(ocnt):</span><br><span class=\"line\">                acnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                val = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                </span><br><span class=\"line\">                total_output_val += val</span><br><span class=\"line\">                a[i][j] = val</span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_special:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> total_input_val != total_output_val:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_legal:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;YES&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;NO&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 5.2 逐行解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- `input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()`: 一次性读取所有输入数据并分割成列表。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`: 初始化指针，指向第一个交易。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `t_str = input_data[ptr]`: 获取第一个交易的类型（字符串形式）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `t = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(t_str)`: 将交易类型转换为整数。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `a = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]`: 初始化二维数组 `a`，用于记录每个交易的输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `f = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]`: 初始化二维数组 `f`，用于记录每个交易的输出是否已被使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">True</span>`: 初始化合法性标志为真。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m)`: 遍历每个交易。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `icnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取当前交易的输出项数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `is_special = <span class=\"literal\">False</span>`: 初始化特殊标记为假。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `current_input_ok = <span class=\"literal\">True</span>`: 初始化当前输入标志为真。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `total_input_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`: 初始化总输入金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(icnt)`: 遍历当前交易的每个输出项。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `source_id = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取源账户ID。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `output_idx = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])`: 获取输出索引。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> source_id == -<span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> output_idx == -<span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 如果源账户和输出索引都是-<span class=\"number\">1</span>，则标记为特殊交易。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> source_id &lt; i <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> f[source_id][output_idx]`: 如果源账户ID小于当前交易索引且该输出项未被使用，则更新总输入金额并标记为已使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">else</span>`: 否则，标记当前输入为假。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ocnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取当前交易的输出项数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `total_output_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`: 初始化总输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(ocnt)`: 遍历当前交易的每个输出项。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `acnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取账户ID。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `val = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])`: 获取输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `total_output_val += val`: 更新总输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `a[i][j] = val`: 记录当前交易产生的输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_special: <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span>`: 如果是特殊交易，则跳过。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> total_input_val != total_output_val: is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">False</span>`: 如果输入金额不等于输出金额，则标记为不合法。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_legal: <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;YES&quot;</span>)`: 如果合法性标志为真，则输出 <span class=\"string\">&quot;YES&quot;</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">else</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;NO&quot;</span>)`: 否则，输出 <span class=\"string\">&quot;NO&quot;</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 5.3 优化技巧</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间优化**: 使用滚动数组来减少空间复杂度。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间优化**: 预处理输入数据，提前计算一些中间结果以减少重复计算。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 6. 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**: O(n)，其中 n 是交易的数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**: O(n)，其中 n 是交易的输出项数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 7. 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **样例输入**:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>  3<br>  2<br>  2 3<br>  1 2<br>  3<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  4<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  5<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  <figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">- **样例输出**:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>  YES<br>  NO<br>  YES<br>  ```</p>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>忽略了指针的正确移动。</li>\n<li>没有正确处理特殊交易的情况。</li>\n<li>没有正确更新总输入金额和总输出金额。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用打印语句跟踪指针的位置和变量的值。</li>\n<li>逐步检查每个交易的输入和输出是否符合预期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 本题学到了如何通过遍历和验证来检查交易账本的合法性。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将类似的合法性检查问题应用到其他场景，如银行账户系统、订单处理系统等。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 可以考虑优化算法以提高处理大规模数据时的效率。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"洛谷-P12209-交易账本-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P12209-交易账本-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P12209] 交易账本 - 洛谷\"></a>[洛谷 P12209] 交易账本 - 洛谷</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: 洛谷</li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★★☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法, 数据结构</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 交易账本的合法性检查</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><p>在本题中，我们需要模拟一个交易账本，该账本记录了一系列的交易。每个交易包括多个输出项，每个输出项都有一个账户ID和一个金额。我们需要判断这些交易是否合法，即每个交易的输出金额是否等于其输入金额的总和，并且每个输出项是否已经被使用过。</p>\n<p><strong>输入格式</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一行是一个整数 ( t )，表示交易的数量。</li>\n<li>每个交易由两部分组成：<ul>\n<li>第一部分是一个整数 ( n )，表示该交易的输出项数量。</li>\n<li>第二部分是两个整数 ( m ) 和 ( m+1 )，分别表示输出项的数量和下一个交易的索引。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>接下来的 ( 2n ) 行每行包含两个整数 ( s ) 和 ( e )，表示第 ( i ) 个交易的起始和结束索引。</li>\n<li>最后一行包含一个整数 ( k )，表示需要检查的账户ID的数量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>输出格式</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果所有交易都合法，输出 “YES”。</li>\n<li>如果存在不合法的交易，输出 “NO”。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路\"><a href=\"#算法思路\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路\"></a>算法思路</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>问题本质</strong>: 这是一个典型的合法性检查问题，涉及到对交易数据的遍历和验证。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>每个交易的输出项数量和起始索引。</li>\n<li>每个输出项的账户ID和金额。</li>\n<li>需要确保每个输出项的金额等于其输入金额的总和，并且每个输出项未被使用过。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>:<ul>\n<li>遍历每个交易，检查其合法性。</li>\n<li>对于每个交易，遍历其输出项，检查金额是否匹配。</li>\n<li>使用一个二维数组来记录每个输出项的使用情况。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用滚动数组来减少空间复杂度。</li>\n<li>预处理输入数据，提前计算一些中间结果以减少重复计算。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>:<ul>\n<li>选择这种基于遍历和验证的方法，因为它能够有效地解决这个问题。</li>\n<li>对比其他算法，如动态规划或图论方法，它们在这个问题中不太适用，因为问题的本质不是最优化或寻找最大值/最小值。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导\"></a>4.3 数学推导</h4><ul>\n<li>在这个问题中，数学推导不是必需的，因为主要问题是逻辑验证，而不是需要通过数学公式来解决的问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br><span class=\"line\">104</span><br><span class=\"line\">105</span><br><span class=\"line\">106</span><br><span class=\"line\">107</span><br><span class=\"line\">108</span><br><span class=\"line\">109</span><br><span class=\"line\">110</span><br><span class=\"line\">111</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> input_data:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    ptr = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    t_str = input_data[ptr]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    t = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(t_str)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(t):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">        m = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        a = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            icnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">            ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            is_special = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            current_input_ok = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            total_input_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(icnt):</span><br><span class=\"line\">                source_id = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                output_idx = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                </span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> source_id == -<span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> output_idx == -<span class=\"number\">1</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    is_special = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> source_id &lt; i <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> f[source_id][output_idx]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    total_input_val += a[source_id][output_idx]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    f[source_id][output_idx] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    current_input_ok = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> current_input_ok:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            ocnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">            ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            total_output_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(ocnt):</span><br><span class=\"line\">                acnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                val = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">                ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                </span><br><span class=\"line\">                total_output_val += val</span><br><span class=\"line\">                a[i][j] = val</span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_special:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            </span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> total_input_val != total_output_val:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_legal:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;YES&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;NO&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 5.2 逐行解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- `input_data = sys.stdin.read().split()`: 一次性读取所有输入数据并分割成列表。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`: 初始化指针，指向第一个交易。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `t_str = input_data[ptr]`: 获取第一个交易的类型（字符串形式）。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `t = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(t_str)`: 将交易类型转换为整数。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `a = [[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]`: 初始化二维数组 `a`，用于记录每个交易的输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `f = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * <span class=\"number\">101</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1001</span>)]`: 初始化二维数组 `f`，用于记录每个交易的输出是否已被使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">True</span>`: 初始化合法性标志为真。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(m)`: 遍历每个交易。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `icnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取当前交易的输出项数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `is_special = <span class=\"literal\">False</span>`: 初始化特殊标记为假。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `current_input_ok = <span class=\"literal\">True</span>`: 初始化当前输入标志为真。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `total_input_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`: 初始化总输入金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(icnt)`: 遍历当前交易的每个输出项。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `source_id = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取源账户ID。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `output_idx = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])`: 获取输出索引。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> source_id == -<span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> output_idx == -<span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 如果源账户和输出索引都是-<span class=\"number\">1</span>，则标记为特殊交易。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> source_id &lt; i <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> f[source_id][output_idx]`: 如果源账户ID小于当前交易索引且该输出项未被使用，则更新总输入金额并标记为已使用。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">else</span>`: 否则，标记当前输入为假。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ocnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取当前交易的输出项数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">1</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `total_output_val = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`: 初始化总输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(ocnt)`: 遍历当前交易的每个输出项。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `acnt = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr])`: 获取账户ID。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `val = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(input_data[ptr + <span class=\"number\">1</span>])`: 获取输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `ptr += <span class=\"number\">2</span>`: 移动指针到下一个交易类型。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `total_output_val += val`: 更新总输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `a[i][j] = val`: 记录当前交易产生的输出金额。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_special: <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span>`: 如果是特殊交易，则跳过。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> total_input_val != total_output_val: is_legal = <span class=\"literal\">False</span>`: 如果输入金额不等于输出金额，则标记为不合法。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> is_legal: <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;YES&quot;</span>)`: 如果合法性标志为真，则输出 <span class=\"string\">&quot;YES&quot;</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- `<span class=\"keyword\">else</span>: <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;NO&quot;</span>)`: 否则，输出 <span class=\"string\">&quot;NO&quot;</span>。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#### 5.3 优化技巧</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间优化**: 使用滚动数组来减少空间复杂度。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间优化**: 预处理输入数据，提前计算一些中间结果以减少重复计算。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 6. 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **时间复杂度**: O(n)，其中 n 是交易的数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\">- **空间复杂度**: O(n)，其中 n 是交易的输出项数量。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 7. 输入输出示例</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">- **样例输入**:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>  3<br>  2<br>  2 3<br>  1 2<br>  3<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  4<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  5<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  1 2<br>  <figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">- **样例输出**:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>  YES<br>  NO<br>  YES<br>  ```</p>\n<h3 id=\"8-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#8-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"8. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>8. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>:<ul>\n<li>忽略了指针的正确移动。</li>\n<li>没有正确处理特殊交易的情况。</li>\n<li>没有正确更新总输入金额和总输出金额。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用打印语句跟踪指针的位置和变量的值。</li>\n<li>逐步检查每个交易的输入和输出是否符合预期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#9-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"9. 总结与扩展\"></a>9. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 本题学到了如何通过遍历和验证来检查交易账本的合法性。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将类似的合法性检查问题应用到其他场景，如银行账户系统、订单处理系统等。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 可以考虑优化算法以提高处理大规模数据时的效率。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12209","path":"api/tags/P12209.json"}]}